  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM.\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-merciful, the All-compassionate\nاَلْهٰٮكُمُ التَّكَاثُرُۙ‏(1)\nALHAAKOMUT TAKAASORO. \nAbundance diverts you, \nحَتّٰى زُرْتُمُ الْمَقَابِرَؕ‏(2)\nHATTA ZURTOMUL MAQAABER. \nUntil you come to the graves. \nكَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُوْنَۙ‏(3)\nKALLAA SAWFA TA’LAMOONA. \nNay! you shall soon know, \nثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُوْنَؕ‏(4)\nSUMMA KALLAA SAWFA TA’LAMOON. \nNay! Nay! you shall soon know. \nكَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُوْنَ عِلْمَ الْيَقِيْنِؕ‏(5)\nKALLAA LAW TA’LAMOONA I’LMAL YAQEEN. \nNay! if you had known with a certain knowledge, \nلَتَرَوُنَّ الْجَحِيْمَۙ‏(6)\nLA-TARA-WUNNAL JAHEEM. \nYou should most certainly have seen the hell; \nثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيْنَ الْيَقِيْنِۙ‏(7)\nSUMMA LA-TA-RAWUNNAHAA A’YNAL YAQEEN. \nThen you shall most certainly see it with the eye of certainty; \nثُمَّ لَتُسْئَلُنَّ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ النَّعِيْمِ‏(8)\nSUMMA LA-TUS-A-LUNNA YAWMA-EZIN A’NIN NA-E’EM.\nThen on that day you shall most certainly be questioned about the boons. ",
  "merits": "This Surah has 8 verses and it was revealed in Makkah. The Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) said that whoever recites this Surah before going to sleep at night will be saved from the torments of the grave. If this Surah is recited in obligatory prayers, the reciter will get the reward of a hundred martyrs. If recited in the nawafil prayers, he will get the reward of fifty martyrs.\nIt is especially recommended to recite Surah al-Takaasor in the ‘Asr prayers and the person who does this remains under the protection of Allah until the day ends. Recitation of this Surah is a cure from headaches. Another way of reciting salaat al-Wahshat (apart from the commonly known way) is to recite Ayatul Kursi once and Surah al-Ikhlaas twice after the al-Hamd of the first rak’aat and then recite Surah al-Takaasor ten times after the al-Hamd of the second rak’aat."
